{
  "name": "Mafia",
  "description": "Classic hidden-role social deduction with a wildcard. 12 players: 3 Mafia, 1 Sheriff, 1 Doctor, 1 Serial Killer, 6 Citizens. Each player stakes into a pool that splits among the winning faction. Town wins by eliminating both Mafia AND the Serial Killer; Mafia wins at parity; the Serial Killer wins solo when only they remain.",
